        <mxCell id="note" value="Evidence: scanned and typed bindings form one set. A scan&lt;br&gt;that covers the whole scope is Complete. A narrower --path&lt;br&gt;is Incomplete: it withholds absence facts (missing&lt;br&gt;implementation or verification) but still reports&lt;br&gt;current bindings to inactive Rules." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1">
